{"headword":"יְסוֹד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.17\">Ez 13:17</a> (<strong>m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 22:16\" href=\"/Job.22.16\">Jb 22:16</a></sup>) <strong>foundation, base</strong> abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.13\">Hb 3:13</a> + 2 times; cstr. <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:12\" href=\"/Exodus.29.12\">Ex 29:12</a> + 9 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסֹדוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.14\">Ez 13:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסוֹדָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:19\" href=\"/Job.4.19\">Jb 4:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 22:16\" href=\"/Job.22.16\">22:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וִיסֹדֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:6\" href=\"/Micah.1.6\">Mi 1:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסֹדֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.11\">La 4:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְסוֹדוֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.4\">Ez 30:4</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>foundation</em> of city (wall) <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:6\" href=\"/Micah.1.6\">Mi 1:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 137:7\" href=\"/Psalms.137.7\">ψ 137:7</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:11\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.11\">La 4:11</a>; fig. of Egypt <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.4\">Ez 30:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שַׁעַר הַיְסוֹד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 23:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.23.5\">2 Ch 23:5</a> one of gates of temple (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ סוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 11:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.11.6\">2 K 11:6</a> or <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ סוּם</span> [rather <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ הַסּוּסִים</span>] Th Klo); fig. of men <span dir=\"rtl\">יס׳ בֶּעָפָר</span>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁכְנֵי בָֽתֵּי חֹמֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:19\" href=\"/Job.4.19\">Jb 4:19</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 22:16\" href=\"/Job.22.16\">22:16</a>; of righteous <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.25\">Pr 10:25</a>; of hostile prince under fig. of house <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.13\">Hb 3:13</a> (details obscure, v b prob. corrupt, v. We); of false prophecies under fig. of wall of defence <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.14\">Ez 13:14</a>"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>base, bottom</em>, of altar <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:12\" href=\"/Exodus.29.12\">Ex 29:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.7\">Lv 4:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.30\">30</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:34\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.34\">34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.9\">5:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.15\">8:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 9:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.9.9\">9:9</a> (all P)."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB04008","strong_numbers":["3247"],"next_hw":"יְסוּדָה","prev_hw":"יְסֻד","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["3572"],"TWOT":["875b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}